docs {
  # Export

  Private downloads of the reader's own data. The **JSON archive** is the complete, portable
  record: every stored record, **soft-deleted ones included** with their `deletedAt`, and every
  historical reference. The CSV files (books, reading sessions, loans) and the Markdown notes file
  are friendlier views, not replacements for the archive. Downloads may contain borrower contact
  details: keep them private.

  Run the folder in order. **Register export reader** creates its own disposable account, checks
  the empty exports, then builds a small library (a book with a quoted title, an ebook later
  deleted, a copy, a reading session, a note with backticks, a loan and a category) and checks the
  populated downloads. It is independent of every other folder.
  Contract: `docs/api-contract.md` ("Export").
}
